        "metadata": {
          "category": "music",
          "media": {
            "duration": 2408,
            "fileSize": 29873994
          },
          "author": "Songs by Ben Lee Delisle",
          "description": "Meet the Numberblocks! They are colourful characters made of blocks that can split apart and join together to do amazing Number Magic. Each one has their own personality and they all love finding out about numbers and discovering how to make new ones! Every episode is magical and musical. But they are not just about counting and adding up – they help children to develop a strong number sense, to see shapes, connections, patterns and families, to discover arrays, square numbers, geometry, number bonds, numbers up to a million and beyond and lots more!",
